        "structural_description": "Casting Throw Weapon now has a 25% chance to transform your next cast of it within 8 seconds into Rapid Throw.Rapid ThrowThrow your ranged weapon 3 times in quick succession, each dealing 50% Ranged Weapon Damage plus 25 Physical damage. Grants Born in Blood. Scales with damage modifiers to Throw Weapon."
